<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva May inflation rises to 0.4 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Geneva May inflation rises to 0.4 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss consumer prices in the Canton of Geneva fell 0.1 percent in May compared with April, but rose 0.4 percent compared with May 1996, the Geneva statistics office said.</p>
<p>				   May 1997   Apr 1997   May 1996</p>
<p>Monthly CPI index change   -0.1 pct    0.1 pct   -0.3 pct</p>
<p>Yr/yr inflation		 0.4 pct    0.2 pct    0.8 pct</p>
<p>Index (May 1993 = 100)	104.2	104.3	103.8</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
